      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test. The original has several understandability issues: unused imports, an unused `DELTA` constant, and magic numbers `33f`/`42f` with no explanation.The improved test compiles successfully. The changes made were: removed the unused `DELTA` constant and all unused imports, extracted the magic numbers `33f`/`42f` into named constants `START_INCLUSIVE` and `END_EXCLUSIVE`, added a `@DisplayName` annotation describing the contract under test, and added descriptive failure messages to both assertions."
